# dlgenter.uis -- (U3) Enter in a single-line text box of a WF_DIALOG window without a
# primary button gives EV_COMMIT (the nested dialog "Weitere Optionen" has only "Schließen")
size 1000 1450
theme light
click "Dialogfenster…"
click "Weitere Optionen…"
expect window 7630 active
click #7632
expect #7632 focused
type "sRGB"
expect text:"Übernommen: 0" exists
key enter
expect text:"Übernommen: 1" exists
expect window 7630 open
expect #7632 text "sRGB"
# Esc first leaves the text box (it keeps the text), then closes the dialog
key esc
key esc
expect window 7630 closed
key esc
expect window 7620 closed
